：星际战斗机太空内部 |蒂姆·弗兰塔</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/air-launch-hypersonics-responsive-space-inside-starfighters-space-tim-franta</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 29 Jul 2026 12:58:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/air-launch-hypersonics-responsive-space-inside-starfighters-space-tim-franta</guid></item><item><title>替代基因网络恢复神经回路</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/alternative-gene-networks-restore-neural-circuits</link><description>一项新研究表明 NAC 抗氧化疗法通过替代基因网络绕过 22q11.2 缺失综合征缺陷。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/alternative-gene-networks-restore-neural-circuits.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 29 Jul 2026 12:43:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/alternative-gene-networks-restore-neural-circuits</guid></item><item><title>Stephen Wolfram：了解未来，探索计算宇宙</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/stephen-wolfram-to-understand-the-future-explore-the-computational-universe</link><description>&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/stephen-wolfram-to-understand-the-future-explore-the-computational-universe.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 29 Jul 2026 12:28:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/stephen-wolfram-to-understand-the-future-explore-the-computational-universe</guid></item><item><title>计算机科学家设计网络攻击来防止网络攻击</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/computer-scientists-design-a-cyberattack-to-prevent-cyberattacks</link><description>保护敏感、精确计时的计算系统需要了解网络威胁的本质。因此，华盛顿州立大学的研究人员与科罗拉多大学科罗拉多斯普林斯分校和大都会州立大学的专家合作，设计了一种名为 NosyNeighbor 的攻击，该攻击潜伏在时间和安全关键的计算机系统的边缘，“推断”内部发生的情况并调整其恶意方法。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/computer-scientists-design-a-cyberattack-to-prevent-cyberattacks2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 29 Jul 2026 12:13:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/computer-scientists-design-a-cyberattack-to-prevent-cyberattacks</guid></item><item><title>你也像AI一样容易被骗吗？取决于您在这张图片中看到的内容</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/are-you-as-easily-fooled-as-ai-depends-what-you-see-in-this-image</link><description>这种来自自然世界的视错觉正在测试计算机视觉的极限&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/are-you-as-easily-fooled-as-ai-depends-what-you-see-in-this-image2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 29 Jul 2026 11:58:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/are-you-as-easily-fooled-as-ai-depends-what-you-see-in-this-image</guid></item><item><title>螺旋纳米颗粒触发癌症警报并提供基因治疗</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/helical-nanoparticles-trigger-cancer-alarms-and-deliver-gene-therapy</link><description>癌细胞通过躲避免疫系统的监视而生存。韩国科学技术院的一个研究小组开发了一种新的抗癌平台，可以使癌细胞发出自己的危险信号，促使免疫细胞发起攻击，同时提供基因治疗。该方法有望提供一种新的治疗策略，将癌症免疫疗法和基因疗法结合在单个纳米颗粒中。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/helical-nanoparticles-trigger-cancer-alarms-and-deliver-gene-therapy2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 29 Jul 2026 11:43:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/helical-nanoparticles-trigger-cancer-alarms-and-deliver-gene-therapy</guid></item><item><title>为什么大脑在做梦时保持活跃</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/why-the-brain-stays-active-during-dreams</link><description>研究人员对自然睡眠期间的小鼠大脑进行成像，追踪血流和能量代谢。快速眼动睡眠增加了血容量和丙酮酸，但减少了神经元 ATP，揭示了一种可能支持记忆相关处理的独特代谢状态。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/why-the-brain-stays-active-during-dreams.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 29 Jul 2026 11:28:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/why-the-brain-stays-active-during-dreams</guid></item></channel></rss>